 ealized he had a different calling after watching Eddie Murphy’s “Raw
 ” for the first time. John decided to move to LA\, leaving Purdue to purs
 ue standup comedy. It was a tough road\, but he made it to LA and never loo
 ked back! His humor is thought-provoking and energetic\, and he provides a 
 unique perspective on everyday life as only he could. You’ll never look a
 t things the same after hearing his thoughts. And he’s only getting start
